                                "example_id": "7a822294-d13e-4c21-8538-f3fd06cbb6ec",
                                "sense_id": "81a14690-f1ec-3fb2-9c03-27b7a6aa0055",
                                "text": "[…] the removal of all soiled liquids, and of such offaling, secretions and excretions as are easily or naturally reduced to a liquid or semiliquid state."
